Useful links


 JRebirth provides versioned Maven sites. The default website (\<www\>) is mapped to the latest stable documentation.
 The WorkInProgress site (\<wip\>) tracks the development line. Previous generated sites remain available under \<sites\>.


* All web sites

	* Website for latest stable version: {{{https://www.jrebirth.org} www.jrebirth.org}}

	* Website for latest development version: {{{https://wip.jrebirth.org} wip.jrebirth.org}}

	* List of all generated Websites: {{{https://sites.jrebirth.org} sites.jrebirth.org}}

* Javadoc

	* Latest stable version (all modules mixed): {{{https://api.jrebirth.org} api.jrebirth.org}}

	* Latest development version (all modules mixed): {{{https://wip-api.jrebirth.org} wip-api.jrebirth.org}}

	* Latest stable version of core module only: {{{https://api-core.jrebirth.org} api-core.jrebirth.org}}

	* Latest development version of core module only: {{{https://wip-api-core.jrebirth.org} wip-api-core.jrebirth.org}}


* Software Factory

